THOUGHT: E.3 needs a persistent gateway-side event poller rather than HTTP-node coupling. I’ll replace the gateway with SQLite channel lookup, JOIN membership, IRC message insertion using the same event sequence, and a background bridge that forwards web events to joined IRC clients while suppressing the originating client’s own message.

